<title>FRANCE: W. Europe Oct new car registrations rose 14.6 pct.</title>
<headline>W. Europe Oct new car registrations rose 14.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car registrations in Western Europe rose 14.6 percent in October to 1,064,500 from the year-ago period, provisional figures from the European car manufacturers association ACEA, showed on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
